# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../doc/learn_more.rst:23
msgid "Learn More"
msgstr "Læra meira"

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../doc/learn_more.rst:24
msgid ""
"We are working hard to expand this user guide and to improve OpenShot Video "
"Editor, but if you are stuck and don't know where to turn, OpenShot has "
"several sources for additional information."
msgstr ""
"Við erum að vinna hörðum höndum að því að stækka þennan notendahandbók og "
"bæta OpenShot Video Editor, en ef þú ert fastur og veist ekki hvert þú átt "
"að snúa þér, þá hefur OpenShot nokkra möguleika fyrir frekari upplýsingar."

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../doc/learn_more.rst:27
msgid ""
"OpenShot has several `YouTube Tutorials "
"<https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLymupH2aoNQNezYzv2lhSwvoyZgLp1Q0T>`_"
" available to help you learn more."
msgstr ""
"OpenShot hefur nokkur `YouTube námskeið "
"<https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLymupH2aoNQNezYzv2lhSwvoyZgLp1Q0T>`_"
" til að hjálpa þér að læra meira."

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../doc/learn_more.rst:28
msgid ""
"OpenShot has a `Reddit User Community <https://openshot.org/forum>`_ "
"dedicated to users helping users, answering questions, and discussing video "
"editing and OpenShot topics."
msgstr ""
"OpenShot hefur `Reddit notendahóp <https://openshot.org/forum>`_ tileinkaður"
" notendum sem hjálpa öðrum notendum, svara spurningum og ræða um "
"myndbandsklippingu og OpenShot málefni."

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../doc/learn_more.rst:29
msgid ""
"If you would like to help improve this User Guide, `view source on GitHub "
"<https://github.com/OpenShot/openshot-qt/tree/develop/doc>`_."
msgstr ""
"Ef þú vilt hjálpa til við að bæta þennan notendahandbók, `skoðaðu heimildina"
" á GitHub <https://github.com/OpenShot/openshot-qt/tree/develop/doc>`_."

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../doc/learn_more.rst:30
msgid ""
"If you have discovered a new bug, please `Report a Bug "
"<https://www.openshot.org/issues/new/>`_."
msgstr ""
"Ef þú hefur fundið nýjan villu, vinsamlegast `tilkynntu villu "
"<https://www.openshot.org/issues/new/>`_."

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../doc/learn_more.rst:31
msgid ""
"If you need professional support, you can open a ticket by sending an "
"message to support@openshot.org or `Schedule a call "
"<https://calendly.com/openshot-support/desktop>`_."
msgstr ""
"Ef þú þarft faglega aðstoð getur þú opnað beiðni með því að senda skilaboð á"
" support@openshot.org eða `pantað símtal <https://calendly.com/openshot-"
"support/desktop>`_."
